# BUILD AN END-TO-END AICTE SECURITY DEPOSIT / FDR MANAGEMENT PORTAL

## 1. PROJECT CONTEXT

Build a complete, production-quality full-stack web application based on the Smart India Hackathon 2026 Problem Statement:

**PS ID:** 26265  
**PS Title:** Streamline of Security Deposit / FDR Portal

The application is intended for the **AICTE Regulation Bureau and other authorized stakeholders** to digitally manage Security Deposits and Fixed Deposit Receipts (FDRs) submitted by technical institutions.

The application must be a **fully functional end-to-end product**, not a static UI prototype.

Every major button, form, filter, search field, workflow, notification, upload function, dashboard statistic, approval action, status change, report and audit feature must actually work.

Do not create fake navigation where buttons do nothing.

The final website should look like a serious government/regulatory enterprise application: professional, clean, secure, accessible, responsive and easy to use.

---

# 2. CORE PROBLEM TO SOLVE

AICTE needs to manage a large number of Security Deposits and FDRs submitted by institutions.

The current problem is that information can become fragmented across manual records, correspondence, documents and different tracking mechanisms.

This makes it difficult to:

- Maintain accurate institution-wise FDR records
- Store and retrieve FDR documents
- Verify submitted information
- Detect discrepancies
- Track maturity and validity dates
- Monitor renewals and replacements
- Track release/refund requests
- Identify pending cases
- Notify stakeholders before deadlines
- Maintain complete historical records
- Maintain accountability through audit trails

Build one centralized portal that manages the **complete lifecycle of an FDR/security deposit**.

